# Playwright Automation Framework

Enterprise-style test automation framework built using Playwright with JavaScript.

## Tech Stack

- Playwright
- JavaScript
- Node.js
- REST API Testing
- SQLite Database Validation
- Jenkins CI/CD
- Git & GitHub

## Framework Features

- Page Object Model (POM)
- Reusable BasePage
- Custom Fixtures
- JSON Test Data
- Environment Configuration
- UI E2E Testing
- API Testing
- Database Validation
- Multi-browser Testing
- Parallel Execution
- Retry Mechanism
- Screenshots on Failure
- Video on Failure
- Trace on Retry
- HTML Reports
- Jenkins CI/CD

